Screen:
| NiceMonMEGA65 V9.9                            the 32-bit NICE CPU of B. Ulmann
| F1 typewriter   F3 key codes
|
|  Each key that you type, or byte sequence that the debug UART sends, shows
|  its bytes in hex and as characters. A control code shows as ^ and a
|  character, so ^[ is ESC and ^? is DEL. A function key with a demo starts it.
|
|  Bytes in hex                            As characters
|  1B 5B 41                                ^[ [  A
|  1B 5B 31 35 7E                          ^[ [  1  5  ~
|  1B 5B 31 3B 35 43                       ^[ [  1  ;  5  C
|  E9
|  80
|  1B 78                                   ^[ x
|  1B 5B 31 3B 32 3B 33 3B 34 3B 35 3B     ^[ [  1  ;  2  ;  3  ;  4  ;  5  ;
|  62                                      b
|  63                                      c
|  64                                      d
|  65                                      e
|  66                                      f
|  67                                      g
|  68                                      h
|  69                                      i
|  6A                                      j
